{"game": "the-anacrusis", "language": "english", "appid": 1120480, "month": "2022-08", "window": 1, "start_date": 1659312000, "end_date": 1661990399, "month_true_total": 5, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-03 00:44:00 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "121115941", "author": {"steamid": "76561197981030821", "personaname": "jezcentral", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jezcentral/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 2824, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1191, "last_played": 1706825453, "avatar": "789d3973c67929581398a13a76e9d24a388d1618"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've been looking for a more modern take on Left 4 Dead, and after the boring face-plant that was Back 4 Blood, we finally have a game that allows you relive L4D's gameplay. While the characters still need more dialogue to make them more interesting, their combat barks are informative enough to let you know what is going on with the other characters by audio alone. The level design is solid, the weapons have been tweaked to give them a bit more heft since the Early Access launch, and the environments are surprisingly varied for a space-ship.\n\nThe characters' movement is very similar to Valve's original, which is a godsend, and the Special Infected are a great mixture of bullet-sponges, like the Brute, and glass cannons, like the Grabber and Spawner. These Special Infected also include some good, new ideas, which are not just recycled from the original Left 4 Dead, which sometimes happens with this type of game. Once you remap the shove and ironsight buttons, you could almost be playing Left 4 Dead. IN SPACE!\n\nEDIT: I'm updating my review for the Steam Awards 2023. Yup, this game is still so much better than Back 4 Blood.", "timestamp_created": 1661266649, "timestamp_updated": 1701101853, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.487495362758636475", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "120764649", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972344860", "personaname": "Das Ganon", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/darth_ganon/", "num_games_owned": 632, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 263, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 263, "last_played": 1652226821, "avatar": "0b3f90a5dfa2176f524212b3e826842bf9d8b3cd"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's Left 4 Dead. In...... Spaaaaaace.", "timestamp_created": 1660710234, "timestamp_updated": 1660710234, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.50688636302947998", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "120538917", "author": {"steamid": "76561199041513241", "personaname": "Whacko Mastermind", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mobs2r/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 202, "playtime_forever": 2903, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2903, "deck_playtime_at_review": 2, "last_played": 1721953970, "avatar": "393af569d8813d0cd6821e093df8d20be5a10bbc"}, "language": "english", "review": "⠀", "timestamp_created": 1660368705, "timestamp_updated": 1765154750, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1642097723", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "120399681", "author": {"steamid": "765